  <p id="c-jinshu-005-jin043-shanjian:office" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">以尚書左僕射<persName id="c-jinshu-005-jin043-shanjian:office:m0006" ref="82k_3oi_qf8">山簡</persName>爲征南將軍、都督荊湘交廣等四州諸軍事</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-005-jin043-shanjian:death" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">夏四月丙寅，征南將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-005-jin043-shanjian:death:m0010" ref="82k_3oi_qf8">山簡</persName>卒。</p>
</text>
